			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numerus,</span>”
				<i>denoting the superficial contents</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Arithm. p. 555</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Isid. 3, 7,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
